        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "If an employee who is scheduled to work on a holiday or who is called into work on a holiday works a second shift during the twenty-four (24) hour period which constitutes the holiday, such employee shall be paid at the rate of two and one-half (2-1/2) times the hourly rate of pay for each hour of the additional eight (8) hour shift(s). The twenty-four (24) hour period which constitutes the holiday shall begin at 12:01 A.M. on the holiday and end at 12:00 Midnight on the following day.",
